      "heading": "The darkness terminator",
      "level": 2,
      "content_markdown": "Lanterna reîncărcabilă Fenix HM65R-T este proiectată pentru alergare. Această nouă lanternă Fenix este construită din material de magneziu. HM65R-T poate atinge 1500 de lumeni prin activarea modului spot și flood în același timp folosind comutatoarele separate. Opțiunea de alimentare principală este o singură baterie 18650; ca opțiune secundară, puteți alimenta HM65R-T cu două baterii CR123A. HM65R-T are, de asemenea, un port USB de încărcare Type C pentru încărcarea bateriei 18650 incluse.\n\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/003-2400x1800-1.jpg?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/004-2400x1800-1.jpg?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/005-2400x1800-1.jpg?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/006-2400x1800-1.jpg?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/007-2400x1800-1.jpg?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/008-2400x1800-1.jpg?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/009-2400x1800-1.gif?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/0010-2400x1800-1.jpg?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/0011-2400x1800-copy.jpg?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/0011-2400x1800-1.jpg?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/0012-2400x1800-1.jpg?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/0013-2400x1800-1.jpg?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/0014-2400x1800-1.jpg?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/0015-2400x1800-1.jpg?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/0016-2400x1800-1.jpg?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/0017-2400x1800-1.jpg?w=1024)"
